Modifications copyright (c) 2026 the idea-scientist contributors.

Changes made: the role, orchestrator and rubric prompts were translated into
Chinese and condensed into agent-skill instructions for OpenAI Codex and Claude;
retrieval over the Svalbard Idea Vault was replaced by public paper APIs and web
search; the reward's hard gates were reimplemented as a run validator. No trained
weights are included.

